  "units": [
    {
      "id": "u_563a9c10a61c87e7b653bad1_0",
      "kind": "title",
      "source": "Bulk Actions",
      "sourceHash": "563a9c10a61c87e7b653bad103fe56717762e39cf493cafcfe711129045f152d",
      "context": "Bulk Actions",
      "contextHash": "24908cc5593d5d8ea1f67ad6b873dd49a8a045f441e35de15d8041d2caccfa93",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_41eee294a9dc405df85fa90b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Bulk Actions__TRILIUM_PH_1__ dialog makes it easy to apply changes to multiple notes at once, ranging from simple actions such as adding or removing a label to being executing custom scripts.",
      "sourceHash": "41eee294a9dc405df85fa90b9f2c28216da9e6eb3f432773bcb79b3b62bd67a9",
      "context": "Bulk Actions",
      "contextHash": "24908cc5593d5d8ea1f67ad6b873dd49a8a045f441e35de15d8041d2caccfa93",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_27591f4e86746d469eb2d832_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Interaction__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "27591f4e86746d469eb2d8323f6dda382149928ec0550ca8a5a6fdfc24cab9a6",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_06f877d47cd655fd3cd6fe80_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The first step is to select the notes in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__. It's possible to apply bulk actions to:",
      "sourceHash": "06f877d47cd655fd3cd6fe80f24cc49010caa2ccca8f57bead4c0f8ea967d022",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_48ecb67a958577fd2cfccf60_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A single note (and potentially its child notes) simply by clicking on it (with a left click or a right click).",
      "sourceHash": "48ecb67a958577fd2cfccf6052869137b0d0f132f2e04778bdf59de1ca9951ef",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bb17d4dabbf1ba50b5b9c743_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Multiple notes. See __TRILIUM_PH_0__Multiple selection__TRILIUM_PH_1__ on how to do so.",
      "sourceHash": "bb17d4dabbf1ba50b5b9c74331b02d258d62848dfad402b39b0a830afdf89867",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c91d173b3f5280c98f0ab656_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Right click in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and select __TRILIUM_PH_2__Advanced__TRILIUM_PH_3__ → __TRILIUM_PH_4__Apply bulk actions__TRILIUM_PH_5__.",
      "sourceHash": "c91d173b3f5280c98f0ab6564e41e1eaae7064414d50ba0d6ace7e56fa96acd4",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b0a424491564a3c3b0650829_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Selected notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ section at the top of the dialog lists the notes the actions apply to. When many notes are selected, only the first few are shown; click __TRILIUM_PH_2__+N more__TRILIUM_PH_3__ to show the rest.",
      "sourceHash": "b0a424491564a3c3b0650829b001a6aed4461bb0d48a7852d4a32940e55ddadd",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_71a7c2c8b3540f3682c81186_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To leave a note out without changing the selection in the note tree, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button on its entry. The last remaining note cannot be removed.",
      "sourceHash": "71a7c2c8b3540f3682c8118621ac3b61afd204a68536755413d00c2c23f079d6",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fe69b464d595e681ace0ca48_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "By default, only the selected notes will be affected. To also include all the descendants of the notes, turn on __TRILIUM_PH_0__Include descendants of the selected notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__. The number of affected notes, shown below that option, updates to reflect the change.",
      "sourceHash": "fe69b464d595e681ace0ca480c0630dcd25424e7fee2059f78b788436836160e",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ce366ad467402399a0f7ec6a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To add an action, click __TRILIUM_PH_0__Add action__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__) at the bottom of the __TRILIUM_PH_3__Chosen actions__TRILIUM_PH_4__ section and pick one from the menu. Hovering over an entry shows a short description of what it does; a detailed description of each is available in the next section.",
      "sourceHash": "ce366ad467402399a0f7ec6ae002c88e2838db47104cf564be5cdf746424d43c",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_263a88daabac36b16d64a29d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Each chosen action appears as an entry in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Chosen actions__TRILIUM_PH_1__ section, with its own configuration.",
      "sourceHash": "263a88daabac36b16d64a29ddb08e6811f07b13f3574f3d7c2338d8b23b00e75",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ae2e842998cce6a0e0151f99_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To remove an action, simply press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__ button to the right of it.",
      "sourceHash": "ae2e842998cce6a0e0151f997fc007d7dea4a1654c43f3627c3e410312a7ec8a",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_58a038e70d77908e78ccc6dc_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "It is possible to apply multiple actions of the same type, such as adding multiple types.",
      "sourceHash": "58a038e70d77908e78ccc6dca7d43d8d1b30f7e46e461680ec0e196448cbc78b",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_aea553c6252d77f124e1fac7_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The fields for a label or relation name suggest the names already used in the database as you type, marking the ones Trilium itself attaches a meaning to.",
      "sourceHash": "aea553c6252d77f124e1fac73c6345ae0120a866370ead8641211382ac82f7a5",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_dea11573061ecfb60f1fcbc4_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The value field of __TRILIUM_PH_0__Add label__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and __TRILIUM_PH_2__Update label value__TRILIUM_PH_3__ suggests the values the named label already has in the database.",
      "sourceHash": "dea11573061ecfb60f1fcbc422f2f6c35e0363879cbba312d35bfb8b73f15542",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_898ef031a57951bef0ac3034_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "When all the actions are defined, press the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Apply to N notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ button to trigger all of them at once. The button names the number of notes that will be affected, and stays disabled until at least one action is added.",
      "sourceHash": "898ef031a57951bef0ac30344cfd55ffab6e315d89918eb9532e27db160fc04b",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cfc4175290bdbcec54348c87_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If an action is missing a field it needs, such as the name of the label to rename, the dialog does not run and points out the empty field instead.",
      "sourceHash": "cfc4175290bdbcec54348c871dd50fd595e530f43b7b9342097b2c84d70961b6",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_dc529c75a168b729ca1cbf70_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For convenience, the last bulk action configuration is saved for further use and will be restored when entering the dialog again.",
      "sourceHash": "dc529c75a168b729ca1cbf70b9b5fef6646493dab1d11d041873e96ccfcde653",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Interaction",
      "contextHash": "363e1ba1f130bb3ea902eb2d4d761baa6028d4c8887d8d4d57cff6dda5a284f2",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7632f9287e26093444674917_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Actions__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "7632f9287e26093444674917b4f78ed3b7dccb4636d1af46c596f3fcfcef2a29",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions",
      "contextHash": "7a19a9586eee18b4c1de7b661a176ce99827e5209dc9667cc90ecb89a38d8b39",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_40af651cd79988ab93e4ca81_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Labels__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "40af651cd79988ab93e4ca81ef95b28a1f7b541633da90fbb8e7d0abf29bd67f",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1677b49a181cb5ac62d5d8eb_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "These actions operate the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Labels__TRILIUM_PH_1__ of a note. Except for __TRILIUM_PH_2__Add label__TRILIUM_PH_3__, they only affect labels set directly on the note; inherited labels are left unchanged.",
      "sourceHash": "1677b49a181cb5ac62d5d8eb05a16788a3095d6fca5a36ab94a957e765396853",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4a539b1bc93f259643c3bd86_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Add label__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "4a539b1bc93f259643c3bd862ed131eed69670409d85d176bfc3364c05bef448",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_499961829176c42457cd67c9_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For each note, it creates a __TRILIUM_PH_0__label__TRILIUM_PH_1__ of the given name. Keep the __TRILIUM_PH_2__New value__TRILIUM_PH_3__ field empty to create a label without a value, or complete it to assign a value.",
      "sourceHash": "499961829176c42457cd67c9aae387cb2a72447b2ff7fb82b0518c4fd77a6249",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4617ff67d261a830330c8b82_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The label is added even if the note already has one of the same name, so the note ends up with both. To change the value of an existing label instead, use __TRILIUM_PH_0__Update label value__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "4617ff67d261a830330c8b825c62090ba132373b4517c2ab5145e94f9e6e6abf",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_454e434775ec8d154bc7d94c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Update label value__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "454e434775ec8d154bc7d94c37ea5c5edac0e2e1da576fadf2259971db37423f",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b2242bc2a5c91c318a15ab64_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For each note, if it has a __TRILIUM_PH_0__label__TRILIUM_PH_1__ of the given name, it will change its value to the specified one. Leave __TRILIUM_PH_2__New value__TRILIUM_PH_3__ field empty to create a label without a value.",
      "sourceHash": "b2242bc2a5c91c318a15ab64a745a074eba5bad94182f37fd99ab9c949cdd4f6",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_72c4159809b3abd668b7cb39_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Notes without the label will not be affected.",
      "sourceHash": "72c4159809b3abd668b7cb39dccea713f46ca0c1b8ba3596f071d2294a64a19b",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fb7d3af65c62b2a3ed7124a5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0____TRILIUM_PH_1__Rename label__TRILIUM_PH_2____TRILIUM_PH_3__",
      "sourceHash": "fb7d3af65c62b2a3ed7124a5bdc6d5b4ca5117cf37cbf4977244d850bfba475d",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7d8ebd9081487a65892dc0fc_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For each note, if it has a __TRILIUM_PH_0__label__TRILIUM_PH_1__ of the given name, it will be renamed/replaced with a label of the new name. The value of the label (if present) will be kept intact.",
      "sourceHash": "7d8ebd9081487a65892dc0fc68bfad3a77797537eb5ac21d99c83b04c4ba2865",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_72c4159809b3abd668b7cb39_1",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Notes without the label will not be affected.",
      "sourceHash": "72c4159809b3abd668b7cb39dccea713f46ca0c1b8ba3596f071d2294a64a19b",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3f85df1384df7b2bc684008e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Delete label__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "3f85df1384df7b2bc684008ea3daedf1d69963cf5330eb2e41213e1c8bd3e019",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a4482cfe0b1845ad13a64902_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For each note, if it has a label of a given name, it will be deleted (regardless of whether it has a value or not).",
      "sourceHash": "a4482cfe0b1845ad13a64902bd51da4b2c8107ffcd5cc70b3e7edb2bfc368a21",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_72c4159809b3abd668b7cb39_2",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Notes without the label will not be affected.",
      "sourceHash": "72c4159809b3abd668b7cb39dccea713f46ca0c1b8ba3596f071d2294a64a19b",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Labels",
      "contextHash": "29c36ca52b8a91493993e8f61a3b8a07d13b5a7ac512d2994566539d5d56c678",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_619d924e969308c4f9f09deb_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Relations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "619d924e969308c4f9f09deb566a7dd33d30be96541809772dcec7fb878ae641",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Relations",
      "contextHash": "18f9bbd43c1b9fb8e7b861b2d8c9a093841e90e124f95b1b988ffe3dd3bf13bd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_fb17141e0fb41b09175bbb38_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "These actions operate the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Relations__TRILIUM_PH_1__ of a note. Except for __TRILIUM_PH_2__Add relation__TRILIUM_PH_3__, they only affect relations set directly on the note; inherited relations are left unchanged.",
      "sourceHash": "fb17141e0fb41b09175bbb38f43dc9cb4c2db198562c7463fdcc8f6a90332fb5",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Relations",
      "contextHash": "18f9bbd43c1b9fb8e7b861b2d8c9a093841e90e124f95b1b988ffe3dd3bf13bd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_84fe6b92ff9235b11fae88e5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Add relation__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "84fe6b92ff9235b11fae88e504b479ab8ea22cd7aa291d572ecb7ba562fb9d46",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Relations",
      "contextHash": "18f9bbd43c1b9fb8e7b861b2d8c9a093841e90e124f95b1b988ffe3dd3bf13bd",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5c2e46392188ee523f7a129a_0",
      "kind": "li",
