    {
      "id": "u_98958780cfcbe811d664842e_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Notes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "98958780cfcbe811d664842ea0a1c00877b19c1cc27f8d1dc743bf1231d25953",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3480ce22ddfb0d99e4749e3b_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Rename note__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "3480ce22ddfb0d99e4749e3bb99e23491caced9044af8b875caf556f8996af3c",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_77727f7eb01f254fc00d10d3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For each note, it will change the title of the note to the given one.",
      "sourceHash": "77727f7eb01f254fc00d10d34e36deb2edb31fdab5fc593ad8cafe847656c5fd",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0fa14e09c0c53944edc5ad6e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The title can contain expressions between __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and __TRILIUM_PH_1__, which are filled in for each note. They can read the note's properties, such as __TRILIUM_PH_2__, __TRILIUM_PH_3__ or __TRILIUM_PH_4__, and call __TRILIUM_PH_5__, __TRILIUM_PH_6__ or, on a date such as __TRILIUM_PH_7__, __TRILIUM_PH_8__. For example:",
      "sourceHash": "0fa14e09c0c53944edc5ad6e94a2b4578bd71f28cd1b371aa6e84c7e28669429",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9fe76416dcff556908a2c526_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ will prefix all notes with __TRILIUM_PH_1__ .",
      "sourceHash": "9fe76416dcff556908a2c52608e3ded6ef391d56db1ebf7bff5638b4e4918af9",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c546802727a9dd0e054bb9b3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ will prefix the note titles with each note's creation date (in month-day format).",
      "sourceHash": "c546802727a9dd0e054bb9b30f27b9b5bb7de829f6f5d444f2e40fd608f86022",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8b5c1ca9fd1a63fe0727def2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Only property access and those methods are allowed, not arbitrary JavaScript. While typing, the field completes the expressions, underlines one that is not allowed and shows the resulting title for the first selected note.",
      "sourceHash": "8b5c1ca9fd1a63fe0727def231106691b719a45f454ff19940eb02f7c6f20828",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3aa98b5dd49cb90d1667b6c3_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Move note__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "3aa98b5dd49cb90d1667b6c3f6d3ea770e7e0bbe43d502cda435fc9f57c4e961",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4f65ce8faecb5ad8681bbe35_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For each note, it will be moved to the specified parent note.",
      "sourceHash": "4f65ce8faecb5ad8681bbe358529a221dab50a6834f88658e1b1c4dbe73df811",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2bf8900fc171cf63fc16b93d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A note with several parents is cloned to the new parent instead, since it is not clear which of its places to remove.",
      "sourceHash": "2bf8900fc171cf63fc16b93d0a08b5c62fc1088150135a84942e553cb59e4216",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ee1339be5b54818acc172ad5_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "A note that cannot be placed there, such as a parent of the target note, stays where it is.",
      "sourceHash": "ee1339be5b54818acc172ad5516c655639061b9667527076c3a5125ca2f15505",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d1c952011a8b2508e56e3257_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "As an alternative for less complex situations, the notes can be moved directly from within the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ via cut → paste or via the contextual menu.",
      "sourceHash": "d1c952011a8b2508e56e32571d82c73adcd4b072bda7a40482a48d0f9f096558",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_735e659d5cfdf580617d785a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Convert note__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "735e659d5cfdf580617d785ab747377c77c7041418c4ac84313b65f32372af7a",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7d39340f25282baf0270721c_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "This allows a note to be converted from one type to another:",
      "sourceHash": "7d39340f25282baf0270721c79c1621c9429aa8cc240ebb6b389b9d8c2d41122",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e50797ac2914d15955a5537f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Text Notes → Markdown Notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ — each __TRILIUM_PH_2__Text__TRILIUM_PH_3__ note is converted to a __TRILIUM_PH_4__Markdown__TRILIUM_PH_5__ note. Since Markdown does not support all the formatting capabilities of Text Notes, some formatting may be lost and some unsupported elements may even be dropped.",
      "sourceHash": "e50797ac2914d15955a5537f9ca4b8cac4fb55504205ce7804ac666ef9161b4c",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7e8c54276d00b4420c142376_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Markdown Notes → Text Notes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ — each __TRILIUM_PH_2__Markdown__TRILIUM_PH_3__ note is converted to a __TRILIUM_PH_4__Text__TRILIUM_PH_5__ Note.",
      "sourceHash": "7e8c54276d00b4420c1423767e0d30a82f558785cc8e2616e3d3cf2c47bc9a05",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a192db7c12802efd64296a47_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For each converted note, a revision is saved automatically, allowing you to restore the original or recover any missing elements from it.",
      "sourceHash": "a192db7c12802efd64296a47f7ac7fb6b896c74bbdeed643accbdac27566201d",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_63277e1e0a3324510f7c7046_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Save revision__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "63277e1e0a3324510f7c7046c6a5e90017ec757668d8d248a09d4790232e1471",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ce4a79417ee7615a2e4fa819_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Automatically creates a revision of each note. Optionally, a name can be assigned to this revision. See __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Revisions__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "ce4a79417ee7615a2e4fa819a777113c4662a1a41e9e365f9b399c0e236666e2",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ad810506d04c087b93b178b0_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Delete note__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "ad810506d04c087b93b178b009d670d5a7fe1fed672d1744599ef60f3aac73a0",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4ae36f44108c3a67362b9687_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "For each note, it will be deleted, including all of its clones and any child notes that are not cloned elsewhere.",
      "sourceHash": "4ae36f44108c3a67362b9687e4f3c0c95a3235497f7fade13fa7666a0c9e3cc0",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9f83b5f2bf02be0fa837e679_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Deleted notes can be restored from __TRILIUM_PH_0__Recent changes__TRILIUM_PH_1__ until they are erased.",
      "sourceHash": "9f83b5f2bf02be0fa837e679e05c351943be1b6e20678315e3dec4617758aa8f",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_34f853b0bc48891d4ade1494_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "As an alternative for less complex situations, the notes can be removed directly from within the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ by selecting them and pressing __TRILIUM_PH_2__Delete__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "34f853b0bc48891d4ade1494e878875106fa02bb1bdc25cc805e723b4e258991",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_3fa25d300561543377973370_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Delete note revisions__TRILIUM_PH_1__",
      "sourceHash": "3fa25d30056154337797337049bb59c80b171c59cdfa50e3a49e2722214ce6a3",
      "context": "Bulk Actions > Actions > Notes",
      "contextHash": "313cbda6ca4fc90f2c7b01f530f3192600ccfd8a2cfc445db9197ac52df56c61",
